*:Zone.Identifier
build/
!build/.gitkeep
*.bin
*.dsk
__pycache__/
*.zx0
# emulator screenshots kept while chasing a bug
errors/

# the level editor's local run configuration
.claude/
editor/workspace/

# THE ACCOUNT LIST IS NOT SOURCE. It is real people's email addresses and it
# lives beside the editor rather than in it (editor/src/.../App_Data/).
App_Data/

# THE ARTIST'S OWN VIEWER FOR THE TWO TITLE PICTURES, delivered beside them:
# MODE 0, the sixteen INKs, LOAD"INTRO.BIN",&C000, CALL &BB18. It is the
# loader 7.7 measured as WRONG - the .scr is 200 lines one after another and
# a CPC screen is eight interleaved raster blocks, so it comes up in eight
# bands. make_intro.py does the conversion the game uses; these stay on disk
# and out of the repository so nobody reaches for them.
#
# Uppercase, and that is why *.bin above does not already cover them: git's
# patterns are case-sensitive on this filesystem.
assets/intro/INTRO*.BAS
assets/intro/INTRO*.BIN
